[00:13.35]Saw a glimpse of myself
[00:13.35]瞥见车窗倒影中的自己
[00:16.21]Out a Greyhound window
[00:16.21]灰狗巴士正穿越荒原
[00:19.94]Headin' for the mountains just north of Seattle
[00:19.94]驶向西雅图以北的群山之巅
[00:24.29]I think I'll grow out my beard
[00:24.29]或许该蓄起胡须
[00:27.25]Then I'll finally get sober
[00:27.25]在清醒中重获新生
[00:31.04]Had to get away it's crazy how a heartbreak travels
[00:31.04]必须逃离 心碎竟能蔓延千里
[00:36.45]And my clothes just smell like smoke
[00:36.45]衣衫浸透烟尘气息
[00:39.45]We been through hell I know
[00:39.45]我们曾共赴炼狱 我深知
